=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/45e0a9a35e1dba1451193f2634f3cf31.webm?t=1770890170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/45e0a9a35e1dba1451193f2634f3cf31.mp4?t=1770890170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/35f2cc59888468214ac969b2320afc8c.avif?t=1770890170\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New combat system for improved gameplay experience. Mastery the Countdown assigned to end turn based on your hand cards. Manage enemies\u2019 actions trigger whenever you Redraw or play cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/b914711924b9e7f751fdf364e4079a30.avif?t=1770890170\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your deck with the new three-in-one card upgrade system. Collect 3 identical cards to choose between two evolution paths, refining your deck while boosting power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Contents</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Pirates Outlaws 2: Heritage has extended experience with additional features and new mechanics to progressively discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain level of Repute and knowledge, invest earned Gold and Gemstones at the Workshop to craft enhanced Golden Cards or banish cards at the Black Market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover your Heritage passives to improve strategies and attributes to defeat legendary creatures and become a Reputed Captain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About Fabled Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FABLED GAME STUDIO</strong>\u00a9 is a game developer studio of entertainment software. Founded in March 2018 and based in Shenzhen, the studio maker of Pirates Outlaws, Pirates Outlaws 2: Heritage and Spiritle, mainly focus on promoting and developing Chinese creativity with passionate member and in an Indie game environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/extras/c504fea9f1230c26625aa770a254a2cd.avif?t=1770890170\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></p>","developers":["Fabled Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025160/2caf553b00e762d7034d346420e712c47dd85812/header.jpg?t=1770890170","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon HD 2400</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11.5<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon HD 2400+</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3025160/1082775172/5651c19d175c621a2d3d727d6c3c5d5d9e63303b/1764659777/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764816560","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3025160/1082775172/5651c19d175c621a2d3d727d6c3c5d5d9e63303b/1764659777/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764816560","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https: